WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.913
Step 1.

2
00:00:00.913 --> 00:00:05.012
Sign in to Graph in the Global
environment, then run the pre-flight.

3
00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:06.888
Six checks for the test stage.

4
00:00:06.888 --> 00:00:09.929
The settings: the
environment is the stage,

5
00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:14.013
every input is named and exists,
and the deploy path is set.

6
00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.112
The Graph module is installed.

7
00:00:16.112 --> 00:00:20.326
The session is in the Global environment
and the tenant the settings name.

8
00:00:20.326 --> 00:00:24.137
The granted scopes cover every
read, and the detection write.

9
00:00:24.137 --> 00:00:26.237
A first read of incidents answers.

10
00:00:26.237 --> 00:00:28.438
And the output root is writable.

11
00:00:28.438 --> 00:00:30.438
Any failure stops the stage.

12
00:00:30.438 --> 00:00:34.340
Then record the pre-flight as
evidence, with the change record.
